      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We confirmed fat hypoxia in obese as compared to lean subjects. However, fat oxygenation was similar in obese insulin sensitive and insulin resistant subjects suggesting fat hypoxia may be simply a consequence of fat expansion."},
